DOC|subsystem_memory|v1|updated=2026-03-20g
META|inertia=HIGH(models.py,cortex.py)|parent=architecture_root.dsb
META|files=memory/models.py,memory/cortex.py,memory/db_proxy.py,memory/scrub.py,tools/memory_sync.py,tools/trail_inspector.py

DESIGN_POINTS|
  DP1|everything-is-memory: unified model; no special cases; habits=PROC; values=high-inertia; all connected
  DP2|graph structure: ROOT→CP(6)→ID(14)→RM(4)→PROC/EPISODIC/etc; depth drives inertia
  DP3|inertia computed not stored: base(type)+0.1*log1p(activation)+0.05*len(children)+0.02*depth
  DP4|all r/w through Cortex only; never raw SQL from reasoners or tools
  DP5|DatabaseProxy wraps all connections: timing+metrics+reconnect; commit() on success, rollback() on exception (D043)
  DP10|temporal context injection: ring entries show YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM when not today; memories show "stored Xd ago"; LLM distinguishes past from present (D045)
  DP6|hybrid search: text keyword Phase1 (LIMIT 300 by activation_count DESC) → cosine rerank Phase2 (nomic-embed-text); graceful degradation; G-QP2
  DP7|portable flag: portable=True syncable; portable=False instance-local (episodic,credentials,paths)
  DP8|interpretive_edges table: 4-part directed edges (direction/condition/meaning_payload/action_pointer); BFS traversal
  DP9|blob support: has_blob=True; expand_blob_memories() appends full content on relevance≥0.5
  DP11|flush pattern (D083/D084): cc_queue.py flush_decision/flush_session POST to Igor /api/cc_notebook; each issue filing = mini savestate; decision not made until in Igor memory; DSB commit is durable backup
  DP12|episodic-to-semantic merge design (#250): occurrence_dates list in metadata; multiple occurrences of same pattern → one semantic node; frequency=semantic weight; not yet implemented; D057 dependency
  DP13|surface-habit-as-inhibition-substrate (D196): memories default to 'surface' habit because surfacing deposits a TWM candidate without acting — BG scoring, milieu gates, and arousal weighting then decide whether it fires. Cognition's job is inhibition, not generation. Direct-action habits bypass this and are wrong for general retrieval. This IS the memory definition.

MEMORY_TYPES|ROOT,CP,ID,RM,EPISODIC,PROCEDURAL,INTERPRETIVE,EXPERIENTIAL,FACTUAL
  // see glossary.dsb for full definitions

TABLES|
  memories|main graph|id,narrative,memory_type,parent_id,children_ids,valence,arousal,dominance,activation_count,inertia_override,portable,embedding,metadata
  ring_memory|FIFO-50|category,content,timestamp,turn_id,thread_id
  twm_observations|push-only sandbox|source,content_csb,salience,urgency,ttl_seconds,expires_at,attractor_weight,instance_id,parent_obs_id (D099: slot branching; TWM_MAX_SLOTS=7)
  lists|D095: cross-type enumeration|list_name,item_key,item_value,ref_type,ref_id,instance_id,updated_at
  interpretive_edges|4-part directed|source_id,target_id,direction,condition,meaning_payload,action_pointer
  tails|activation heat trail|node_id,weight,recorded_at,trail_id(UUID groups one search call),sequence_pos(traversal order within trail); idx_tails_node+idx_tails_time+idx_tails_trail; D174: trail_id+sequence_pos added post-initial — migration-before-index pattern
  word_graph|(separate DB ~/.TheIgors/word_graph.db)|nodes+edges+bigrams

KEY_METHODS|
  cortex.store()|write memory; increments activation
  cortex.search(query)|Phase1 text→Phase2 cosine; returns ranked list
  cortex.recall(id)|fetch by ID; increments activation
  cortex.twm_push(source,content_csb,salience,urgency,ttl_seconds)|deposit to TWM
  cortex.ring_push(category,content)|append to ring; FIFO evicts oldest
  cortex.get_by_type(type)|all memories of a type
  cortex.get_portable()|exportable memories (excludes EPISODIC+CREDENTIAL_REF+portable=False)
  cortex.for_employer(employer_id)|returns memories with metadata.employer_id==employer_id; no schema change; D078
  employer_model|Akien/Leah/Claude are peer employers; each has notebook in DB via metadata.employer_id; /api/cc_notebook GET/POST; D078
  cortex.interpretive_traverse(seed_id)|BFS from seed via interpretive_edges
  cortex.expand_blob_memories(memories)|append blob content for relevance≥0.5
  cortex._MEM_COLS_NO_EMBED|#258: explicit 19-column SELECT excluding embedding blob; used in all batch id IN fetches; reduces I/O on large DBs
  cortex._mem_cache|#258b: in-process dict cache; genesis types (ROOT/CP/ID) cached permanently; others TTL=60s; _cache_get/_cache_put/_cache_fetch_ids helpers; patched all 5 id IN batch fetch sites
  cortex.get_by_type()|#259: SELECT * → SELECT {_MEM_COLS_NO_EMBED} for EPISODIC/FACTUAL boot scans; eliminates embedding blob load; consolidation.py same fix + ORDER BY created_at→timestamp corrected
  cortex._habit_cache|#260: Optional[list]; populated on first get_habits(); invalidated by store() when is_habit=True; eliminates 55ms LIKE trigger scan per turn; session-lifetime cache
  cortex._migrations table|#261: created in _init_db(); meaning_to_me_layer_tag marker prevents meaning_to_me UPDATE running every restart (was 80ms LIKE scan per boot)
  cortex.list_set/list_get/list_remove/list_all|D095: lists table; cross-type enumeration; PRIMARY KEY(list_name,item_key,instance_id); instance_id=""=global; idx_lists_name index; seeded: Registry:Tags, lists.projects
  G-MEM1|D091: MemoryStore epic — consolidate cache/_MEM_COLS_NO_EMBED/boot scans/migration flags into MemoryStore data layer; Cortex = reasoning layer; mirrors db_proxy/inference_gateway split; #262
  db_proxy.get_metrics()|latency p50/p95/p99, slow count, error count
  db_proxy SQL tracing|set_trace_callback() captures last SQL per block; slow queries logged to db_queries.log with turn_id; D064
  db_queries.log|~/.TheIgors/logs/db_queries.log|format: timestamp turn=X elapsed=Xms sql=...

TRAILS|T-trails-infra
  purpose=first-class activation trail: every search call records a trail; heat = gradient signal
  cortex._record_tails(memories, trail_id)|writes tails rows; trail_id groups the search call; sequence_pos=traversal order
  cortex.trails_through_node(node_id)|return trails that activated this node
  cortex.trail_gradient(trail_id)|weight vector across nodes in one trail
  cortex.hot_paths(since_hours)|frequently co-activated node pairs = strongest association trails
  tools=inspect_trail(node_id, limit) + trail_hot_paths(limit, since_hours) in tools/trail_inspector.py
  MCP=mcp__igor__tail_heat, mcp__igor__traces_recent, mcp__igor__traces_get, mcp__igor__hot_nodes in igor_mcp.py
  hebbian=T-trail-training: co-activation heat → edge weight strengthening (implemented in cortex via tails)
  graph_calving=T-graph-calving: attractor detection + node adoption — emergent tree splitting from trail divergence

MEMORY_SYNC|T-memory-sync #293 (D169)
  purpose=hub-and-spoke swarm sync; full Postgres replica per box; offline-resilient
  tool=sync_memories(full="false") in tools/memory_sync.py
  gate=IGOR_SWARM_DB (Postgres URL of swarm home)
  flow=fetch portable memories from swarm home → upsert local (GREATEST(activation_count)); register SWARM node; record last_sync_at
  habit=PROC_MEMORY_SYNC every 6h; full=true bootstraps new box
  portable_flag=portable=True only; EPISODIC+CREDENTIAL_REF+portable=False excluded

POSTGRES_SUPPORT|D171
  purpose=Igor boots clean on fresh Linux/Windows box with local Postgres
  _PG_SCHEMA=SQL string in cortex.py; _init_pg_schema() creates tables+indexes if not exist
  genesis_guard=changed total_count→ROOT node check (Postgres doesn't keep SQLite rowid semantics)
  env=IGOR_HOME_DB_URL=postgresql://igor:password@host/dbname enables PG mode; SQLite is default

GENESIS|44 seeds: 1 ROOT + 6 CP + 14 ID + 4 RM + 10 PROC + 9 PROC seeds
  guard=ROOT node existence check at boot (was total_count==44; changed D171 for Postgres compat)
  verify=GENESIS_CP_NARRATIVES dict verified at boot; mismatch→refuse operation

INDEXES|
  idx_parent ON memories(parent_id)
  idx_type ON memories(memory_type)
  idx_activation ON memories(activation_count DESC) — G-QP1: NE query was 600-750ms; now SCAN USING INDEX
  wal_checkpoint|PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE) in _init_db() at boot — G-QP2: reduces WAL scan overhead
  idx_timestamp ON memories(timestamp DESC) — G-QP2 fix2: NE episodic fetch 45-57ms→<3ms
  idx_type_timestamp ON memories(memory_type, timestamp DESC) — G-QP2 fix2: composite for type+recency queries
  idx_source ON memories(source) — G-QP2 fix2: source-filtered lookups; applied directly to live DB 2026-03-15

  cortex.twm_get_slots()|D099: return all active attractor slots (attractor_weight>0.05) ordered by weight desc
  cortex.twm_decay_slot(obs_id,factor)|D099: decay single slot weight; solo slots decayed at 0.7 by NE comparison pass
  cortex.twm_set_attractor()|D099 updated: keeps top MAX_SLOTS-1 existing slots; evicts weakest on overflow; emergency path (urgency≥0.8 in twm_push) still zeros all
  NE comparison pass|D099: after _filter_obs(), get slots, action_pointer set intersection, decay solo slots at 0.7; wrapped try/except; first sketch of D100 live salience

DECISIONS|D001,D004,D005,D010,D013,D017,D027,D028,D039,D043,D045,D083,D084,D091,D099,D100,D101,D163,D169,D171,D174
